      "title": "Windows host",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Physical Windows CPU, RAM and selected volumes. Runner readiness is shown separately in Rabbit Agents. A lost exporter means telemetry is unavailable; it does not establish that the computer is powered off. Windows disk counters can lag by 10–15 minutes."
      }
